@startuml
title Console — initdb
actor Operator
participant "Console Program" as CLI
participant IAppDataInitializer as Setup
database "SQLite" as DB

Operator -> CLI : initdb
CLI -> CLI : Open console rolling file logger
CLI -> CLI : Build host and open service scope
CLI -> Setup : MigrateAsync()
Setup -> DB : Apply outstanding migrations
CLI -> Setup : SeedAsync()
Setup -> DB : Seed sample Smurfs if empty
CLI --> Operator : Print database initialized
CLI -> CLI : Dispose scope, host, and then file logger
CLI --> Operator : Exit 0
@enduml
